        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mine, clay</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mine, clay
Data are estimated based on an air-picture and sketches of the process. The avarage yearly production volume is about 100'000 t, Total land occupation: 40'000m;
UUID: 5e02b5cb-5c03-34ec-a70a-294b78b89cac
includes the area of the "build" infrastructure (buildings, roads, etc.) used for brick and roof tile production
Location: For some exchanges RER modules have been used as proxy
Technology: The data of the infrastructure corresponds to the high level of technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: The estimation of land use and infrastructure relates to one company in Switzerland (Ziegelei Gasser AG in Rapperswil BE) 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5e02b5cb-5c03-34ec-a70a-294b78b89cac.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
